<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eletrobras started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eletrobras started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming analyst Walter Stoeppelwerth has started coverage of Brazilian utility Eletrobras SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a June 17 analysis, he said he made the recommendation because the privatization of Eletrobras subsidiaries and a regulatory model &quot;will allow Eletrobras to monetize its hydroelectric generation assets at values well above those implicit in the existing market capitalization.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 12 reais to 583 in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
